\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Method overview of CHORD. Stage 0 constructs query-relevant anchors and anchor weights before autoregressive decoding. Stage 1 applies rollback-based past protection to repair already-collapsed prefixes. Stage 2 reranks the top-$k$ candidates through object-resonant current scoring and bounded future arbitration under shared-KV rollout. Stage 3 admits the candidate with the highest aggregate score.}}{3}{figure.caption.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:method_overview}{{2}{3}{Method overview of CHORD. Stage 0 constructs query-relevant anchors and anchor weights before autoregressive decoding. Stage 1 applies rollback-based past protection to repair already-collapsed prefixes. Stage 2 reranks the top-$k$ candidates through object-resonant current scoring and bounded future arbitration under shared-KV rollout. Stage 3 admits the candidate with the highest aggregate score}{figure.caption.6}{}}
